name: Stop one active request in a nine-boundary plan and recover unresolved spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME stop
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/large-scope-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 27 planned | fixed-work
expect: 0 total attempts
expect: no deck-launched dispatcher
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART waiting
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 1 completed | active-request
expect: K stop
keys: K
keys: Escape
expect-echo-within: 250 operator scope draft
live-snap: responsive-stop
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stopped
require-live-snap: 20 no deck-launched dispatcher | settled-stop
expect: operator scope draft
ask: Does Stop preserve the operator draft and responsive input while the process actually settles, without refunding the active provider reservation?
keys: C-u
nav-mode:
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 26 parked | paused-jobs
expect: Stopped by operator
ask: Are the completed pass, attempted canceled pass and 25 unstarted jobs distinguishable within the same immutable 27-job plan?
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | partial-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 partial acknowledged | partial-accepted
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 1 unresolved | partial-report
expect: 2 committed / 4 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
ask: Does the report preserve the completed observation, missing evidence, unresolved spending and per-boundary denominators without a complete coverage claim?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: partial-report-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/large-scope-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 26 parked | recovered-work
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain all 27 jobs, consumed attempts and the unresolved reservation without restarting work or treating a missed observation as a fix?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
